          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure (a) shows the picture of a blue triangle with a dotted line. What if you fold the triangle along the dotted line? Yes, one half of the triangle covers the other half completely. These are called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "mirror halves",
